OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CDad calls for 'crisis' education to    
OL,5,Creduce suicide among men and boys      
OL,6,GA father whose son died by suicide on  
OL,7,Gthe day after his 22nd birthday has    
OL,8,Gcalled for more education on how men   
OL,9,Gand boys can seek help during a mental 
OL,10,Ghealth crisis.                         
OL,12,FSeamus Waites said there was "no       
OL,13,Fwarning sign whatsoever" before his    
OL,14,Fson Thomas took his own life in May    
OL,15,F2016, just hours after he went out to  
OL,16,Fcelebrate with friends.                
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
