OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CIrish reality star dances her way to   
OL,5,Cfinal of Dancing with the Stars        
OL,6,GMaura Higgins is arguably Love         
OL,7,GIsland's biggest success story.        
OL,9,FSince leaving the villa in Majorca,    
OL,10,FHiggins maintained a high profile in   
OL,11,Fthe UK, Ireland and across the         
OL,12,FAtlantic where she has presented Love  
OL,13,FIsland: Aftersun in the US, and was    
OL,14,Frunner up in The Traitors US.          
OL,16,FWhile she failed to find love with     
OL,17,FCurtis Pritchard in the 2019 series,   
OL,18,Fshe may have picked up a few of the    
OL,19,Fballroom dancer's moves.               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
